  "body": "Breathtaking panoramic views stretching from Auckland's iconic Sky Tower across the sparkling Hauraki Gulf to Kawau Island and Orewa. With generous spaces and exciting potential this coastal home offers an exceptional lifestyle opportunity.\r\nPositioned on a freehold title to capture stunning elevated sea views, this spacious three-bedroom, three-bathroom home combines comfortable family living with flexibility, expansive outdoor entertaining and plenty of opportunity to add value.\r\nUpstairs, a generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flows seamlessly onto expansive decking, creating the perfect setting for entertaining or simply relaxing while enjoying the magnificent coastal panorama. This level features two bedrooms, including a master with ensuite, plus a family bathroom. A large utility room provides exciting potential to create a third upstairs bedroom, home office or additional living space.\r\nDownstairs, a double internal-access garage connects to a spacious open-plan rumpus, lounge or bedroom area, complete with its own bathroom. Largely in original condition, this versatile space offers fantastic potential to modernise, accommodate extended family or explore granny flat accommodation and supplementary income, subject to necessary approvals.\r\nThe location is another standout feature, with Coast Plaza's shopping, cafés, eateries and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. Plenty of additional off-street parking provides convenience for family and visitors alike.\r\nWhether you're looking for a spacious family home, multigenerational living or an opportunity to add value, this freehold property offers an exciting combination of location, lifestyle and potential.\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure these spectacular views and make this coastal home your own!\r\n\r\nCall Mel or Sam to arrange a private viewing otherwise we look forward to seeing you at the open homes.\r\n\r\nAuction: Friday 4th December 2026 at 5pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/BWTC",
